					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1936767#post-2754143</guid>
				<title>+1</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1936767/koi-format#post-2754143</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 24 Feb 2017 02:14:06 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Bluemorpho</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2911597</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>YES HOW DID I NOT KNOW THIS WAS A THING</p> <p>Once I was at a hotel with a huge koi pond. There were a ton of koi in the pond, and they all crowded under the bridge for some reason. And by a ton, I mean a ton. It was a huge, pulsating mass of gulping fish.</p> <p>I soon found out why they were under the bridge.</p> <p>At the hotel lobby, they gave out fishfood to drop under the bridge. I dropped the food, and it was chaos. The fish flopped everywhere to get at the food. After I had fed them a couple times, they started freaking out every time I even shook my hand over the pond.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
