					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1936767#post-2666389</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1936767/koi-format#post-2666389</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 06 Oct 2016 18:31:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Scorpion451</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1918720</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I was referring to the tail dancing, but still interesting. Could be that he was sort of a mutt, half butterfly and half another breed&#8230; also possible that he was their &quot;fancy&quot; fish- maybe the first one they got when they started the pond or something.</p> 
